        }
      ],
      "content": "thrum, the ends of the warp-threads left unwoven and attached to the loom when the web is cut off; waste threads of yarn; tuft, tassel or fringe of threads at the edge of a piece of cloth (OED s.v. thrum n.2); sometimes of silk"
    }
